  (text "No tone stack · no bias supply · no negative feedback. Both channels mix INSIDE the phase inverter, at opposite grids. Rails: B+1 +315 V · B+N Normal · B+P inverter · B+V vibrato" (at 12.7 258.598 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "1290c8a2-5084-48a9-9ecf-2a08fb6a927c"))
  (text "Heaters, the 6.3 V winding and the pilot-lamp wiring are an annotation layer — see netlist.cir, bom.yaml and layout.yaml." (at 12.7 262.998 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "1aa62111-70ae-4236-9d93-9b5bf75fd6dd"))
  (text "The two-position TONE network, the five-section phase-shift ladder, the ECC82 modulator network and the ECC83 oscillator network (with Depth, Speed, the fast/slow switch and the footswitch jack) are listed part by part in bom.yaml. The published drawing resolves their VALUES but not their interconnection, so this sheet names the interfaces and asserts nothing further. The phase-shift vibrato bends pitch rather than gating level — see notes.md." (at 12.7 267.398 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "d19f44f3-e196-49eb-8622-8174da564407"))
